window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Conflicted. Determined. Unbreakable.</b></p> <p>The secrets I've kept are unraveling, and the lines between Ivy Hammond and Poison are blurring dangerously. Thornfield University has become a battlefield where my past and present collide.</p> <p>The assassin in me knows I should complete my missions, but my heart rebels against the very essence of who I thought I was.</p> <p>Torin, Bram, and Tate are no longer arrogant distractions, but they're now integral to my survival and sanity. But our growing bond comes with a price, and my bosses won't let go of their prized assassin without a fight.</p> <p>I'm caught in the crossfire between my baggage and theirs, and my choices could tip the balance of power in the supernatural world.</p> <p>So who am I really? Ivy or Poison? Assassin or girlfriend? Enemy or ally?</p> <p>I have to decide where I truly belong. But I won't go down without a fight. The hunter is becoming the hunted, and it's time to show them all what happens when you corner a poisonous vine.</p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
